1046	REG_CHINESE_0009	Jain Vegetable Wontons	Lunch/Dinner	Chinese	Medium	30	1. Sauté bell peppers, corn, and cabbage with light soy sauce and white pepper (no garlic, ginger, or onion). 2. Place filling in wrapper center, fold into triangle, seal tips together. 3. Deep fry till golden or steam for 8 minutes.	chinese_foods.csv	\N	Jain
