8692	IND_CUISINE_02874	Sweet Corn And Raw Mango Salad Recipe	Snack	Indian	Medium	35	['To begin making the Sweet Corn And Raw Mango Salad Recipe, first peel off the skin of Mangoes and grate in a medium sized bowl.', 'Wash and add the corn to the bowl containing the grated Raw Mangoes and mix well.', 'Drizzle the Kasundi mustard sauce and honey and toss chopped green chilies on top of the Sweet Corn And Raw Mango Salad Mixture as a dressing. Sprinkle half a teaspoon of black salt and mix well.', 'Finally garnish the\\xa0Sweet Corn And Raw Mango Salad with finely chopped coriander leaves on top.', 'Serve\\xa0Sweet Corn And Raw Mango Salad Recipe as a salad with\\xa0Fish Molee Recipe\\xa0and\\xa0Steamed Rice\\xa0for a wonderful Sunday afternoon lunch.']	Indain_Food_Cuisine_Dataset.csv	\N	Vegetarian
